The wmcp_reminder/ visual layer is adapted from CursorTouch/Windows-MCP
(MIT licensed) desktop/control_overlay.py, control_overlay_art.py,
flash_overlay.py, overlay_bitmap.py — modified for dynamic text, dynamic
accent color, removal of WDA_EXCLUDEFROMCAPTURE, and no human-takeover
control flow.
